<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Automated Oil farmer with a 1920 x 1080 Resulution</Major>
    <Description>This Macro is made for people who need to pump Oil from the oilpump at the Server Grand RP. This macro is fully automated except that the Capchas have to be solved manually every 15 minutes. But you can for example remote control your PC and solve the capchas via Remote control from your tablet (mobile i wouldnt recommend because of the screensize). This macro is made for Joblvl 3. For LVL 2 or 1 this macro woudnt work because with LVL 3 you can pump slightly faster and the macro is optimized for that. Also you would pump faster when you played 4 hours this day, this macro will work with that, but just as fast as without the 4 hours dayplaytime. 
PS: I didnt made the macro as fast as possible because the more "press time" you will take away, the more risk you will have to not get the pumpcycle to the end, because every time you need randomly slighly more or less press time. Why? IDK

Made for 1920  x 1080 FHD Resulution (remake of the WQHD version, because a few people asked me to make also in FHD)

Capchas needs to be solved manually (every +-15 min)

What you need: Oilpumper LVL 3,

4 hour dayplaytime optional (wouldnt make you pump faster with this makro)</Description>
    <Comment>Mouse Positions had to be repositioned. Original was in 2440 x 1440, but i got notifications to make my skripts also in 1920 x 1080.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 240 603
LeftDown 1
Delay 500 ms
MoveTo 322 601
Delay 3600 ms
LeftUp 1
LeftDown 1
Delay 500 ms
MoveTo 405 600
Delay 3600 ms
LeftUp 1
LeftDown 1
Delay 500
MoveTo 491 604
Delay 3600 ms
LeftUp 1
LeftDown 1
Delay 500 ms
MoveTo 240 603
Delay 3700 ms
LeftUp 1
GoWhile 2 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>